// @Component
// class NightlyExportJob : Lifecycle { … }
//
// Exactly one GraphCondition may carry a given tag; two produce
// "Multiple GraphCondition components match condition tag", none produces
// "Component condition cannot be resolved".
//
// GraphCondition.and(...) / .or(...) compose conditions. Nested conditional components inherit their
// parents' conditions, combined with GraphCondition.and.
//
// Choosing between @Conditional, @DefaultComponent and @Nullable, and the compile-time
// rules for declaring conditions, are covered by the kora-di-compile skill.
